--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -60,4 +60,20 @@ The following formats are supported:
 - .XB - The eXtended Binary XBin format, supporting custom character sets and palettes
 
+# ASCII text extraction
+
+`ansilove_text(ctx, options, loader, &buffer, &length)` runs a standard format
+loader with a text backend and returns a NUL-terminated ASCII string. Free the
+returned buffer with `free()`. Input loading and metadata removal are the same
+as for the PNG API. Existing PNG data and caller options are preserved.
+
+The result follows the final rendered cell layout, with non-ASCII/control glyphs
+and characters with equal foreground/background colors replaced by spaces.
+Trailing spaces and outer blank rows are trimmed. Only printable ASCII and LF
+are returned. This does not perform OCR or preserve previous animation frames;
+custom-font remapping and existing parser limitations still apply. Character-grid
+storage is limited to 64 MiB. See `ansilove_text(3)` for the full API contract.
+
+Run the text-backend regression tests with `ctest --test-dir build` after building.
+
 # Documentation
 
